# Tool versions for MicroGPTEx -- a DECLARATION, not a mechanism.
#
# No version manager is in use on this machine (erlang and elixir are homebrew
# provided) and this project has no CI, so nothing here is obliged to obey this
# file. Its one real consumer is `bin/devbin check toolchain`, which compares
# these pins against the running toolchain and fails when they diverge.
#
# Policy (hv): run the latest, and keep this file matching what you actually
# run. These are the fleet's pins as of 2026-08-10 -- identical to Conflab,
# Laksa, Baize and Lamplight.
#
# mix.exs requires `~> 1.19`, which the pin below satisfies; the pin is the
# tighter statement of the two and this file is its one home.
#
# Lines are parsed as `^<tool> <version>` -- keep comments free-form above them.
erlang 29.0.5
elixir 1.20.3-otp-29
